{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50665","headline":"送友人罢举归东海 · 雍陶","name":"送友人罢举归东海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沧沧天堑外，何岛是新罗？\n舶主辞蕃远，碁僧入汉多。\n海风吹白鹘，沙日晒红螺。\n此去知提笔，须求利剑磨。\n（见韦庄《又玄集》卷下。\n熊飞云《全唐诗》卷五三一收此爲许浑诗。\n今检《文苑英华》卷二八○收此爲许诗，而许浑自书之乌丝栏诗真蹟及席刻本《丁卯诗集》、《四部丛刊》影宋钞《下卯集》中皆无此诗。\n应爲谁作，尚难断定。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}